---
import Page from "~/layouts/Page.astro";

const updated = new Date("2025-11-28")
---

<Page title="Info about my name and pronouns" back="/" date={updated}>
    <h3 class="text-xl">hi, my name is ivy</h3>

    <p class="mt-2">my full name is [miss.] ivy rose turner</p>
    <p>unless required, please keep my name lowercase</p>
    <p>if you know any of my old names, please do not use them</p>

    <h3 class="text-xl my-2">my pronouns are she/her <span class="text-xs text-yin-7 dark:text-yin-3">unless you know different</span></h2>
    <p>
        if you know that, and you continue to use any others (including they/them) for me, <br>
        it's still misgendering <span class="text-yin-7 dark:text-yin-3 text-base">& i reserve the right to throw you into the sun</span>
    </p>

    <span class="text-sm mt-4">thank you to <a class="link" href="https://eta.st/nomenclature/">eta</a> for the idea for this page :3</span>
</Page>
